WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.209 --> 00:00:02.044
♪♪

00:00:02.044 --> 00:00:04.338
Touchdown, Jimmy Keene!

00:00:04.338 --> 00:00:07.007
♪♪

00:00:07.007 --> 00:00:09.426
Dennis Lehane:
Black Bird is the story of Jimmy
Keene.

00:00:09.426 --> 00:00:12.888
He grew up a suburban kid
athlete.

00:00:12.888 --> 00:00:14.514
Dennis Lehane:
He liked cars, he liked women.

00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:17.643
He’s a very smart guy, charming,
good listener.

00:00:17.643 --> 00:00:18.936
Well, what’s your ambition?

00:00:18.936 --> 00:00:20.979
♪♪

00:00:20.979 --> 00:00:22.856
Taron Egerton:
I think he thought he could walk
on water.

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:24.650
♪♪

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:29.154
It’s the judgement of the court
that the defendant be committed
to one hundred and twenty months.

00:00:29.571 --> 00:00:33.242
He’s a very good kid who did
some bad things along the way.

00:00:33.242 --> 00:00:35.953
Dad, tell me there’s a way out
of this.

00:00:35.953 --> 00:00:37.204
Big Jim:
Not a quick one.

00:00:37.204 --> 00:00:43.669
♪♪

00:00:43.669 --> 00:00:46.296
He’s offered an opportunity to
redeem himself.

00:00:46.296 --> 00:00:50.926
We would like you to transfer to
another prison and befriend
someone to elicit a confession.

00:00:50.926 --> 00:00:55.514
♪♪

00:00:55.514 --> 00:00:59.226
You want me to check into hell
and befriend a demon.

00:00:59.935 --> 00:01:02.062
Not for all the money in the
world.

00:01:02.938 --> 00:01:04.022
How about freedom?

00:01:04.022 --> 00:01:07.859
♪♪

00:01:07.859 --> 00:01:12.239
Larry’s world is a true
darkness, and that’s the world
that Jimmy enters.

00:01:12.239 --> 00:01:13.365
♪♪

00:01:13.365 --> 00:01:16.660
In my dreams, I like... kill
women.

00:01:16.660 --> 00:01:18.161
♪♪

00:01:18.161 --> 00:01:18.787
You know?

00:01:18.787 --> 00:01:23.542
♪♪

00:01:23.542 --> 00:01:23.959
Sure.

00:01:24.876 --> 00:01:26.169
(Thunder)

00:01:26.586 --> 00:01:28.213
Larry Hall was a puzzle.

00:01:28.213 --> 00:01:29.589
♪♪

00:01:29.589 --> 00:01:32.092
It's impossible to understand
his mentality.

00:01:32.092 --> 00:01:32.884
♪♪

00:01:32.884 --> 00:01:34.553
Why are you looking at me like
that?

00:01:34.553 --> 00:01:37.973
♪♪

00:01:37.973 --> 00:01:40.475
Like you know me.

00:01:40.475 --> 00:01:42.352
Taron Egerton:
Larry gets in his head.

00:01:42.352 --> 00:01:44.938
And Jimmy is horrified by it.

00:01:44.938 --> 00:01:46.648
Jimmy was in something that was
bigger than him.

00:01:46.648 --> 00:01:47.566
Bigger than anything.

00:01:47.566 --> 00:01:50.777
Dennis Lehane:
And if he screws this up, this
guy will be out into the world again.

00:01:50.777 --> 00:01:54.865
Lauren:
If he walks, he’ll kill again
and again.

00:01:54.865 --> 00:01:56.700
♪♪

00:01:56.700 --> 00:01:58.702
Jimmy has no protections left.

00:01:58.702 --> 00:02:00.329
He has no armor left.

00:02:00.329 --> 00:02:01.163
He has nothing.

00:02:01.997 --> 00:02:03.874
You think you could be in
danger.

00:02:03.874 --> 00:02:06.126
♪♪

00:02:06.126 --> 00:02:07.044
James:
Six, one, two!

00:02:07.711 --> 00:02:09.004
You are in danger.

00:02:09.004 --> 00:02:10.422
♪♪

00:02:10.422 --> 00:02:11.965
Larry:
Something’s gonna happen.

